        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Dormant wallet reactivation",
          "why": "Sleeping wallets suddenly draining or becoming targets of legal claims carry a thriller quality — unclaimed fortune or forgotten risk that can resurface years later."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "On-chain whale and institutional tracking",
          "why": "Readers track large named wallets (Tom Lee's BitMine, a16z HYPE accumulation, Bhutan sovereign BTC) to infer institutional positioning before it hits headlines."
