        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "One-API developer wallet infrastructure",
          "why": "Multiple headlines (Crossmint, Base MCP, Polygon Open Money Stack, Enso Quote Simulator) show readers tracking the race to commoditise wallet plumbing for builders."
